  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"cat-description\"><p><em>midi-qol: Utter Vow gives you advantage on attack rolls against the creature for 1 minute; Transfer Vow moves the vow to another creature within 30 feet when the first drops to 0 hit points, keeping the time left. Uses are tracked on this item: on a 2024 Paladin, point Utter Vow's consumption at your Channel Divinity feature.</em></p><p><em>No rules text (not SRD; Player's Handbook (2024)): give the character your own copy and apply this automation to it with CAT's medkit, which keeps your copy's description.</em></p></div>",
